title dexter drawn prompt -- the editable line rendered into a terminal row, caret always in view, GREEN
prompt autonomous loop -- take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, send often, stop at custody gates
think The line editor, its history, and the prompt session all stand GREEN and sent. The honest next crux is the OUTPUT of the input half -- drawing the editable line into a terminal row a keeper can see, the bridge from dexter_line/dexter_shell to scooter_view's drawn frame. Pure, ungated, Rye-first, finishable green in one lap.
think Built pond/apps/dexter_prompt.rye: render_prompt folds a prompt prefix and an editable line into one 80-column row (the same width scooter_view draws its journal in, imported as view.frame_cols), tracking the column the caret sits at. The crux is horizontal scroll -- when the line is wider than the row, the window anchors so the cursor is always visible (at the last column when the caret is at the end, at the prefix when at home). A prefix leaving no room for the line refuses PrefixTooWide.
think The window rule is stateless and correct: win_start = cursor >= avail ? cursor - avail + 1 : 0, so the caret column is always < row_cols by construction (proven by an assert on cursor_col). The row is always exactly row_cols cells, space-filled beyond the drawn content.
obs GREEN on the first metal run -- no red. tame_style_check bans clean, width-check exit 0, new prose plain ASCII, American spelling. The witness build compiled the unchanged dexter_line and scooter_view, so both stand intact -- composition, not modification.
obs The input family now has all four floors: the editable line (dexter_line), its history ring (dexter_history), the prompt session that weds them (dexter_shell), and the drawn row that shows it (dexter_prompt). Only the live keystroke reader (a raw TTY) and the wire between piers remain -- both reach the serve gate, the maintainer's hand.
obs Rota lap (d27, item 25) deep-read active-designing/20260816-205859_double-seat-expansion-eight-seasons.md -- Season G (Open Media Primitives) names the terminal family (Dexter + Scooter) beside image and sound; this whole arc is climbing Season G's terminal rung, ungated and Rye-first.
loom witness=dexter_prompt_witness selftest=GREEN row_cols=80 selftest_cases=4 composes=dexter_line+scooter_view
